        {
          "text": "Ariko turazi yukw ivy’ ivyagezwe bivuga vyose bibibgira abaganzwa na vyo, kugira ngw akanwa kose kazibge, kand’ abari mw isi bose babe abo gutsindwa n’urubanza imbere y’Imana: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
